<view class="form-page">
  <view class="hero form-hero"><text class="hero-title">{{isEdit ? '编辑课程' : '添加新课程'}}</text><text class="hero-subtitle">{{isEdit ? '把课程安排，更新得刚刚好。' : '第一笔，记下新的成长计划。'}}</text></view>
  <view class="page-content form-content">
    <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error-box">{{error}}<button class="secondary" bindtap="loadCourse">重新连接</button></view>
    <view wx:if="{{!ready && !error}}" class="loading">正在确认课程与账号…</view>
    <view class="panel form-section">
      <text class="small-heading">01 / 课程信息</text>
      <view class="field"><text class="field-label">课程名称</text><input id="course-name" class="input" placeholder="例如：周末游泳课" placeholder-class="input-placeholder" value="{{course.name}}" bindinput="onNameInput" maxlength="50" disabled="{{!ready || saving || saved}}" /></view>
      <text class="field-label">课程类型</text>
      <view class="type-grid">
        <button wx:for="{{courseTypes}}" wx:key="type" class="type-item {{selectedType === item.type ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-type="{{item.type}}" bindtap="onSelectType" disabled="{{!ready || saving || saved}}"><text class="type-icon">{{item.icon}}</text><text>{{item.name}}</text><text wx:if="{{selectedType === item.type}}" class="type-check">✓</text></button>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="panel form-section">
      <text class="small-heading">02 / 课时账本</text>
      <view class="number-grid">
        <view><text class="field-label">总课时 <text class="optional">可选</text></text><view class="number-input"><input id="total-lessons" class="input" type="number" placeholder="不设上限" placeholder-class="input-placeholder number-placeholder" value="{{course.totalLessons}}" bindinput="onTotalLessonsInput" maxlength="6" disabled="{{!ready || saving || saved}}" /><text class="number-unit">节</text></view></view>
        <view><text class="field-label">开始使用前已上</text><view class="number-input"><input id="initial-lessons" class="input" type="number" placeholder="0" placeholder-class="input-placeholder number-placeholder" value="{{course.initialLessons}}" bindinput="onInitialLessonsInput" maxlength="6" disabled="{{!ready || saving || saved}}" /><text class="number-unit">节</text></view></view>
      </view>
      <view class="form-total-note"><text class="info-icon">ⓘ</text><view class="grow"><text>开始使用前已上，只计累计、不计月统计。</text><text class="form-note-emphasis">已逐条补记的课时，请勿重复填写。</text></view></view>
      <text class="hint">总课时留空或填 0 表示不设上限；续课时增加总课时。</text>
    </view>
    <view class="panel form-section">
      <text class="small-heading">03 / 上课备忘</text>
      <view class="field"><text class="field-label">固定上课时间 <text class="optional">可选</text></text><input id="course-schedule" class="input" placeholder="例如：每周六 10:00" placeholder-class="input-placeholder" value="{{course.schedule}}" bindinput="onScheduleInput" maxlength="100" disabled="{{!ready || saving || saved}}" /><text class="hint">仅作为备忘显示，不自动发送提醒。</text></view>
      <view class="field"><text class="field-label">备注 <text class="optional">可选</text></text><textarea id="course-notes" class="textarea" placeholder="老师、教室，或其他想记住的事" placeholder-class="input-placeholder" value="{{course.notes}}" bindinput="onNotesInput" maxlength="500" disabled="{{!ready || saving || saved}}" adjust-position="{{true}}" cursor-spacing="100" /></view>
    </view>
    <text class="under-note">先安全保存在本机，网络正常时自动同步到当前微信账户。</text>
  </view>
  <view class="save-bar"><button id="save-course" class="primary save-button" bindtap="onSave" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{!ready || !canSave || saving || saved}}">{{isEdit ? '保存修改' : '添加课程'}}</button></view>
</view>
